3935..4012 Comment "/// Winding a composite is summing the windings (cubical\'s `winding-hom`), by"
4013..4087 Comment "/// induction on the first loop, written last because a recursion descends"
4088..4159 Comment "/// its last parameter, and summed with `wind(q)` first because the sum"
4160..4235 Comment "/// descends its second summand: `here(wind(q))` on the empty word, and the"
4236..4313 Comment "/// recursive call carried along `up` or `down`. The composite in its type is"
4314..4389 Comment "/// read off the parameters\' written types (#423), and the kernel reads its"
4390..4458 Comment "/// endpoint `plus(wind(q), wind(p))` as the call it returns (#424)."
